msgid "布局、缓存和导出参数调好后，手动保存一套可复用的设置，也会记录分组折叠状态与右栏宽度。"
msgstr "Di store a reusable snapshot of layout, cache, and export settings, including collapsed sections and sidebar width"

msgid "Load"
msgstr "Di latest"

msgid "尝试其他参数后，找回手动保存的那套设置。"
msgstr "Di Restore your saved snapshot afta try oda settings."

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Dem Reset"

msgid "恢复默认参数、分组折叠状态和自动栏宽。手动保存的快照仍可用 Load 取回。"
msgstr "Di Restore default settings, section state, and automatic sidebar width Di Load don still retrieve your saved snapshot"

msgid "正常关闭后再启动会恢复上次使用状态。这里的 **Save** 保存配置；工具栏上的磁盘图标导出图像。"
msgstr "A normal restart restor di last session’s settings **Di save awa** Di configuration wey dey store for di configuration Di disk icon on di toolbar exports images"
